  "ruleText": "Nuh 403.01 Evidence of CEUs. The nursing home administrator shall be required to retain all certificates or other documented evidence of participation in an approved or accredited continuing education program or course for a period of at least 3 years.\n\nSource. #1393, eff 7-1-79; ss by #2224, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2922, eff 12-10-84, EXPIRED: 12-10-90\n\nNew. #5097, eff 3-18-91; rpld by #5326, eff 2-13-92, EXPIRED: 2-13-98\n\nNew. #7663, eff 3-19-02, EXPIRED: 3-19-10\n\nNew. #9830-A, eff 12-10-10, EXPIRED: 12-10-18\n\nNew. #12690, eff 12-19-18",
